  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Chronic pain of the left ankle and hindfoot with a limp, for many years since an old gunshot wound to the foot, worse over the past two years: pain 7 of 10 on walking, stiffness in the mornings, walking limited to about half a mile; cause to be confirmed by imaging</td><td>resolved</td><td>confirmed</td>
